  "solution": {
    "text": "Given parallel lines are\r\n\r\n$3 x-4 y+7=0$ and $3 x-4 y+5=0$\r\n\r\nRequired distance $=\\frac{|7-5|}{\\sqrt{(3)^{2}+(-4)^{2}}}=\\frac{2}{5}$ $\\Rightarrow a=2, b=5$",
